        "descriptions": [
            {
                "value": "The Dataset contains pictures and the corresponding video of experiments with a flexible trowel. The pictures are taken to verify the deformability of the developed trowel with and without lateral force - compensation. Without compensation the desired cubic spline shape was only observed for smaller deformations (>10mm per axis). With lateral compensation very good results were achieved (ca. +-70mm per axis).",
                "descriptionType": "Abstract",
                "lang": "en"
            }
